# │   a normal language ships packages: manifest + compressed payload.   │
# │                                                                       │
# │   scroll1  jav42      JAVΛ42 symbolic runtime language                │
# │   scroll2  meowwow    MEOWWOW unified platform + HSON + hson1         │
# │   scroll3  heritage   raw sovereign corpus (no loss)                  │
